  "description": "A coastal fortified settlement dating to the late Bronze and early Iron Ages, known in modern times as Castro de Coci\u00f1adoiro and A Punta de Muros. The site was excavated ahead of its complete destruction in the first decade of the 21st century as part of the development of the Porto Exterior da Coru\u00f1a at Punta Langosteira.",
